  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#prepare-an-image-for-presentation step 16 is only run if one of the earlier steps didn't return. I think that can be read as \"don't render cross-origin images\" or \"don't render images with bogus EXIF\", which is not intended.\n\ncc @noamr ",
